  "name": {
   "zh": "法线贴图 · Sapiens2",
   "en": "Normal Map · Sapiens2"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Sapiens2 是一组高分辨率 transformer，面向以人为中心的视觉任务，重点在泛化、通用和高保真输出；法线估计的角度误差比第一代低 45.6%。这张卡整幅画面逐帧估计人体法线（摄影机空间），交付一套 EXR 的 normal 图层；人以外的地方也有数、只是没有意义。",
   "en": "Sapiens2 is a family of high-resolution transformers for human-centric vision tasks, focused on generalization, versatility and high-fidelity output; its normal estimation has 45.6% lower angular error than the first generation. This card estimates human normals (camera space) for the whole image per frame and delivers the normal layer of an EXR; areas outside the people have values too, but they mean nothing."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
